D. Torque: The King’s Game

Season 1

Detective D. Torque investigates a series of strange cases that appear unrelated.

A man falls from the sky.

A coffee cup becomes the key to a murder.

A missing witness disappears before testifying.

A warehouse burns under mysterious circumstances.

A silent phone contains evidence nobody expected.

As the clues connect, D. Torque discovers a hidden conspiracy led by Victor Hale.

Every victim knew part of a secret.

Every case was connected.

The game is over.

The King has finally been found.

